WEBVTT

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:33.640
Nikiwa na miaka 19, nilishinda shindano
la utafiti, katika tafiti yangu ya miamba maji,

00:06:33.664 --> 00:06:35.179
Na nikaishia kuzungumza

00:06:35.203 --> 00:06:37.454
Katika kongamano la UN
la utofauti wa kibayolojia,

00:06:37.478 --> 00:06:38.974
nikiwasilisha utafiti huu.

00:06:38.998 --> 00:06:40.686
(Makofi)

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:41.868
Asante.

00:06:41.892 --> 00:06:46.790
(Makofi)

00:06:46.814 --> 00:06:50.809
Na nikiwa na miaka 22, ninajiangaa
kumaliza chuo,

00:06:50.833 --> 00:06:55.368
na ni mwanzilishi-mwenza wa kampuni
ya kibayoteki inayoitwa AutismSees.

00:06:56.275 --> 00:06:57.283
(Makofi)

00:06:57.307 --> 00:06:58.562
Asante.

00:06:58.586 --> 00:07:01.263
(Makofi)